{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15674","headline":"闲居寄苗发 · 司空曙","name":"闲居寄苗发","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"渐向浮生老，前期竟若何。\n独身居处静，永夜坐时多。\n厌逐青林客，休吟白雪歌。\n支公有遗寺，重与谢安过。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15674.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15674","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}